<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Efesoone Asaas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosi Efesoone Asaas Xaafida Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efesoone Asaas</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Phawuloosi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Efesoone Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi Efesoone asaas xaafida kiitay harappeka kasetidi izi lo7eththi xeellizay, «Xoossa sheney polettanay saloninne Sa7an diza medheteththati wurikka issife issi Kirstoosa Godateththaa gars aadhdhiza wodey gakkishinna» (1:10) giza qofaa bolla. Qasseka Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa issifeteththaan asa zereththi wurikka issino gidana mala hayssa gita qofaa ooson peyshshana mala Xoossa dereza qofsizaaza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Efesoone kiitaan koyro kifileza xaafezi issifeteththa gishshas doommidi ayfe yo7oza aassidi Xoossa Aaway dereza wostti dooridaakko, ba naaza Yesus Kirstoosa baggara istti ba nagarappe maaroteth demmidi waani attidaakonne Xoossa gita hidotaa qaalay Xillo Ayana baggara waani qonccidaakko erisees; nam7anththo kifilezan qasse xaafezi nababizayti issifeteththa de7on Kirstoosan isttas diza issifeteththay tumu gidana mala istti waani waani de7anaakko istta qofsees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Asay Kirstoosan diza issifeteththaan ay mala issifeteththi isttas dizaakko dumma dumma haasaya qommotan qonccides; Woosa keeththi Kirstoosa asateth gidishin Kirstoosi qasse asateththas hu7e mala. Woosa keeththaya gimbe keeththa mala gidishin Kirstoosi qasse keeththas gulan uttiza shuchcha mala; Woosa keeththiya machchi mala gidishin Kirstoosi qasse azina mala; xaafezi Kirstoosa baggara qonccida Xoossa kiyateththaa keehi dhoqqisi yootiza wode ciimmateththi diza qaalan yootees. Ubba miishsheka izi xeellizay Kirstoosa siiqon, iza yarsheteththan, iza maaroteththan, iza kiyateththaninne iza saroteththa baggarakko!</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Geloso <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kirstoosanne Woosa Keeth <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1:3—3:21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kirstoosan gidida ooraththa de7o <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 4:1-6:20">4:1—6:20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kuushsha qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6:21-24</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Xoossa shene mala Yesus Kirstoosa Hawaare gidida Phawuloosappe, Yesus Kirstoosan diza ammanettizaytas Efesoonen ammaniza asaas,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">Hawa 18:19-21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />nu Aawaa Xoossafenne Godaa Yesus Kirstoosappe kiyateththinne saroteththi inttes gido.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirstoosappe Beettiza Ayana Anjjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa baggara salon Ayana anjjo ubbaan nuna anjjida Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa Aaway Xoossi anjjetto. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Nu iza sinththan geeshshinne wosoy bayndayta gidana mala buro alamey medhettanaappe kase ba siiqon Kirstoosa baggara nuna doorides. <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Yesus Kirstoosa baggara nu iza naa gidana mala ba lo7o qofaan koyro ubbaa woththides. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Hessika ba dosizaade baggara coo mela nuus imettida bonchcho kiyateththi galatettana malassa.<verse eid="EPH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Xoossa aadho kiyateththa dureteththaafe dendoyssan Yesusa suuththan wozzettidi nagarappe nu maarettidos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Qola 1:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />Izi ba kiyateththaa, hiillateththaninne erateth ubbaan nu bolla keehi darssides. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Xoossi qoppida ba xuura qofaa Kirstoosa baggara ba lo7o qofaa mala nuna erisides. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Buroppe wode wurseththan hananaas diza iza qofay salo bollanne biitta bolla dizaytas ubbaas hu7e gidida Yesus Kirstoosappe ubbaa gars aaththanaassa. <verse eid="EPH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Wursika ba shene mala ooththiza iza shenen koyrokka izi qoppi woththidayti nuni izan doorettidos. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Nuni kasetidi Kirstoosa baggara ekkana giidi ufayssan naagizayti Xoossa bonchcho galatan qonccisanaassa.<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Intteka qasse tumaa qaalaa hessika inttena ashshiza Mishiraachcho qaalaa siyidi Kirstoosan ammanideta; iza ammanidi kase imettana geetettida Xillo Ayana maatamen attamettideta. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />He Ayanazikka iza bonchcho galatan qonccisana mala Xoossi baas gididayta ubbata wozzana gakkanaas nu laatas oyso.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Galatanne Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15-16" />Hessa gishshas intte Godaa Yesusa ammanida gishshassinne ammaniza asaa intte siiqizayssa ta siyoosoppe haa simmiin inttena qoppa qoppa ekkada tani ta woosan intte gishshas Xoossas galata shiisho aggabeekke. <verse eid="EPH 1:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Bonchcho Aawaa gidida nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa Aawaa Xoossaa intte lo7eththi erana mala qonccisiza Ayanaynne erateththa Ayanay inttes imettana mala ta inttes pacey baynda woossays. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Hessaththoka intte izan xeygettida ufayssay hessika ammanizayta achchan diza iza dureteththi aazakkonne intte erana mala intte wozina ayfey poo7ana mala woossays.<verse eid="EPH 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19-20" />Nuus ammanizaytas ubbaafe bolla gidida iza wolqqa dhoqqateth intte erana mala ta woossays; he wolqqayka iza gita minoteththaa ooson bessidayssi hayqoppe Kirstoosa denththidi salon ba ushachchan utissida Kirstoosa baggara.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maza 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:19-20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Ayssizaytappe, godateththafe, wolqqafenne kawoteththafe qasseka ha7i xalla gidontta buroppe yaana wodekka gidiin sunth ubbaafe izi bolla. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Xoossi hara wursi iza tohoppe garsan haarisides; Woosa keeththankka ubbaa bolla hu7e ooththides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Maza 8:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Woosa Keeththiya Kirstoosa asateththa; he izakka ubbason ubba miish kunththiza he iza kumeththa.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kirstoosa Denth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Intte qohida qoho gishshassinne intte nagara gaason intte hayqqideta shin; <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />hessa intte hayssa alameza iita oge kaallideta; bolla carko bolla diidi haariza wolqqama ayanatas ha7ikka Xoossas azazettontta asaa bolla ooththiza iita ayanas intte azazettishe gam7ideta. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Hayssafe kase nuni nu asho amoteth polishe ashoy koyza oge kaallishe isttara doos; nunikka hankko asa mala nu medheteththafe Xoossa hanqo garsan de7oos.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4-5" />Gido attiin Xoossi keehi siiqida gishshas ba maaro daron nuni nu qoho daroteththaan hayqqidayta gidi dishin Kirstoosa baggara nuna ashshides; intte paxiday iza kiyateththanna. <verse eid="EPH 2:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Xoossi nuna Kirstoosara gaththi denththides; Yesus Kirstoosa baggara nuna salon banara utissides. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Hessika hayssafe guye yaana wodezan Yesus Kirstoosi nuus ba kiyateththan qonccisida zaway baynda ba kiyateththa dureteththaa nuna bessanaassa. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Intte Xoossa kiyateththan ammanon attideta; hessika Xoossi inttes mela coo immidazaappe attiin intte oosoppe gidenna. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Oonikka ceeqettontta mala oosoppe gidenna. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Hessika Xoossi kase koyro giigsi woththida lo7o ooso nuni ooththana mala Yesus Kirstoosa baggara nuni nam7anththo medhettidaytanne Xoossa medheteththata.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirstoosan Beettiza Issifeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Hessa gishshas intte kase intte yeleteththan Ayzaabeti intte asateththa bolla asa kushe ooso gaason, «Nuni qaxxarettidos» giza asati inttena, «Qaxxarettonttayta» gizaytoo! Intte hessa ane wozinan woththite. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Intte he wode Kirstoosappe shaakettidi, Isra7eele naytappe haakkidi, caaqo qaalaska allaga gididi, hayssa alameza bolla hidotaynne Xoossi baynda kase intte diza duussaa yuushshi qopite. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Ha7i qasse intte kase haahon dizayti Yesus Kirstoosan gididi iza suuththaa baggara shiiqideta.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Nam7ata issi bolla gaththidi giddon shaakki ooshshiza miishshaa laallida nu saroy iza. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Wogaa, woga azazora gaththi issife ba ashon shaarides; izi hessa ooththida gaasoykka izas waanna qofay nam7atappe issi ooraththa as ba baggara medhdhidi saroteth ehanaassa. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Izi masqale bolla hayqqidi morkketeth diggides; nam7atakka issi asho histtidi Xoossara maqayinththides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Qola 1:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Izi yiidi inttes haakki dizaytassinne matan dizaytas gaththi saroteth sabbakides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Isa 57:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Nu wurikka iza baggara issi Ayanan Aawaa ach shiiqana.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Hessa gishshas intte ammanizaytara issife issi dere asanne Xoossas soo asa attiin hayssafe guye betetanne imaththata gidekketa. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Intte Hawaaretanne nabeta yochchan keexettideta; keeththaas wurseththa kuushshay Yesus Kirstoosa. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Keeththazi wurikka issife oykettidi Godaas dumma keeththe gidanaas diccees. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Intteka Xoossi ba Ayanan daanaas izas duussaso gidana mala issife keexettishe deeta.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ayzaabetas Hawaare Gidida Phawuloosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Hessa gaason ta Phawuloosi inttes ammanonttayta gishshas Yesus Kirstoosi qachchidaade gidadis. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Ta inttena go7ana mala Xoossi kiyateththan taas oosos exa immidayssa intte tumappe siyideta. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Hayssafe kase ta inttes qaanththara xaafida mala taas qoncciin ta eranaas dandayda xuuray hayssa. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Hessa gishshas intte hessa nababishe Kirstoosa xuura ta ay mala eridaakko intteka eranaas dandayeeta. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />He xuuraykka ha7i ammaniza Hawaaretassinne nabetas qonccida mala kase beni aadhdhida wode diza asataskka qonccibeenna. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Hessi he xuuray Ayzaabeti Mishiraachcho qaalaa baggara Isra7eele naytara issife laattizayta; issife issaade asateththa mala gididi Yesus Kirstoosa baggara beettida hidota issife gishetti laattizayta gidanaassa.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Tanikka iza wolqqa ooso mala taas imettida Xoossa kiyateththa imota mala hayssa Mishiraachcho qaalaa oosanchcha gidadis. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Ta qasse hankko ammaniza asaappe laafa gidikkoka oonikka zaway baynda Kirstoosa dureteth Ayzaabetas sabbakana mala Xoossa kiyateththan hayssi taas imettides. <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Hessaththoka ubbaa medhdhida Xoossaan beni wode qotetti diza Xoossaas xuura qofay aazakko ubbaas ta qonccisana mala taas Xoossa kiyateththi imettides. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Iza qofay ha7i wode Woosa Keeththa baggara dumma dumma medhay diza Xoossa hiillateththi salon diza halaqatassinne godatas erettana mala hanides.<verse eid="EPH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Xoossi nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa baggara hayssa poliday ba mernaa qofaa mala. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Nuni izayta gidida gishshassinne izan ammanida gishshas geeshshateththaranne hirgay baynda nuni Xoossako shiiqana dandayoos. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Hessa gishshas intte bonchchettana mala tani intte gishshas ta bolla gakkida waayezan intte ufays qanxxontta mala ta inttena hadara gays.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Efesoonen Ammaniza Asaas Woosettida Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Hessa gishshas tani Xoossa sinththan gulbatays. <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />Salon dizaynne biitta bolla diza izaso asay wurikka izi sunththiin summees. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Intte garsa baggara minnana mala Ayana baggara iza bonchcho dureteththi inttes imettana mala ta woossays. <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />Hessika Kirstoosi intte wozinan ammanon daana malanne qasseka intte izan xaphidi siiqon minnana mala woossays. <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />Kirstoosa siiqos aahoteththay, adussateththay, dhoqqateththaynne ciimmateththi ay ginakko intte ammaniza ubba asaara issife shaakki erana mala. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Intte Xoossaa kumeththara shaakki eridi izan kumeth gidana mala asa erappe bolla gidida Kirstoosa siiqo intte erana mala ta woossays. <verse eid="EPH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Hessa gishshas nu giddon ooththiza ba wolqqaa gina nu woossizayssafenne woykko nu qoppizayssafe ubbaafe bollara keehi darssi ooththanaas dandayza Xoossaas, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Woosa keeththan qasseka Yesus Kirstoosa baggara wode ubbaan mernaappe mernaa gakkanaas izas bonchchoy gido. Amiin.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kirstoosa Baggara Beettida Issifeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Hessa gishshas Godaa sunththan qashettida tani intte xeygettida xeyssaas bessiza duus daana mala inttena woossays. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Mulekka ashketanne shugota gidite; issoy issaara siiqon diitenne issoy issaa dandayte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:12-13">Qola 3:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Saroteth immiza Ayana issifeteth naaganaas minnite. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Intte xeygettida gallas issi hidotaakko xeygettida mala issi asateththinne issi Ayanay dees. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Issi Goday, issi ammanoynne issi xinqatay dees. <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Ubbaafe bollara gididay, ubbaa bolla ooththizay, ubbason dizay, ubbaas Aawaa gidida issi Xoossi dees.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Gidikkoka Kirstoosi immana gi qachchida mala nuus issaas issaas dumma dumma imoteththi imettides. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Hessa gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">«Izi pude kezida wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">di7o di7ides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">Asaas kiyateththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">imota immides»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EPH 4:8">geetetti Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Maza 68:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Histtiin, «Izi pude kezides» guussi qasseka duge biitta gars wodhdhides guus gidontta aggiko hessi ay guussee? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Izi duge garse wodhdhidayssi kumeth alame medheteth kumana mala saloppeka bolla keziday iza.<verse eid="EPH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Issi issi asati Hawaareta, baggayti Nabeta, harati Mishiraachcho qaala sabaake, baggayti qasse heemmizaytanne tamaarsizayta gidana mala izi imota immides. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Hessika Kirstoosa asateth gidida Woosa Keeththiya keexettana mala ammanizayta ammano oosos giigsanaassa. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Hessika hananay nu wurikka Xoossa Naa ammanoninne iza eron beettiza issifeteththaako gakkidi kumeththa as gidanaas Kirstoosan nuni Kirstoosaththo kumeththinne polo gidana malassa.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Hessa gishshas abba bolla dendiza gote carkoy yaanne haa shocechchiza mala dumma dumma timirte carkon asa geneninne baleththon ane nuni yaanne haa phonqettishe qeeri guuththa nayta mala hanokko. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Hessaththo hano aggidi tumaa siiqon haasayshe hu7e gididayssaako hanizaazan ubbaan ane diccoos; he hu7ezikka Kirstoosa. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Iza gaason asateththi wuri xaphon oykettidi issi issi asateththi ba ooso ooththishe wurikka siiqon dicceessinne banakka minththees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Qola 2:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poo7o Nayta Mala Duus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Ayzaabeta mala coo mela qofan mela simerettanaas inttes bessenna gaada ta inttena zorays. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Istta wozinay muumida gishshassinne yuushshi qoppontta gishshas istta wozina ayfey qooqides; istti Xoossa de7oppe shaakettida. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Isttafe yeellateththi dhayda gishshas ba koyida mala bana kalssontta amoninne tunateththan daanaas wogay baynda iita oosos bana aaththi immida.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Intte qasse Kirstoosa hessa malan eribeekketa. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Ee tumukka intte iza gishshas siyidetanne Yesusan diza tumaa izappe tamaardeta. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Intte kase diza duussay baleththiza amon qitattida gishshas kase ceega asateth inttefe qaari yeggana mala tamaardeta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:9">Qola 3:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Qasseka intte qofay Ayanan ooraxo. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Tumu xilloteththaninne geeshshateththan Xoos misatana medhettida ooraththa asateth may7ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:10">Qola 3:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Nu wurikka issi asho gidida gishshas wordoteth diggidi nuni nu garsan issoy issaara ane tumaa haasayoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Zaka 8:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Hanqettite shin nagara ooththofte; intte hanqon dishin arshey wullofo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Maza 4:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Xala7es soho immofte. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Kase kaysotizaadey hayssafe guye kaysotoppa; gido attiin metotettidi iza woossizaytas immiza miishshi iza kushen daana mala lo7o miish ba kushera ooththi demmanaas daaburo.<verse eid="EPH 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Koshshiza mala hankko siyizayta go7izaazinne maaddiza qaalappe attiin go7ay baynda qaalay intte doonappe kezoppo. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Intte attana gallassas attamettida Xoossaa Xillo Ayana mishisopite. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Camo yo7o ubbaa hanqo, yiillo, oosh, cashshe, qasseka hankko hara iitateth ubbaa inttefe diggite. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Inttena Xoossi Kirstoosa baggara atto gida mala intteka intte garsan atto atto geetettite; issoy issaara kiyatanne issoy issaas qadhettizayta gidite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:13">Qola 3:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Hessa gishshas intte dosettiza nayta mala Xoos misatite. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Kirstoosi nuna siiqida mala qasseka nu gishshas bana sawiza yarsho ooththi Xoossas immida mala intteka siiqon simerettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Kessa 29:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Maza 40:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Laymay woykko tunateththi woykko uuzeteththi mulekka intte giddon beetoy attiin zigirsika siyettofo; hessa malay geeshsha Xoossa asas bessenna. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Intte galata galatizayta gidite attiin ase yeellachchiza laafa haasayay, coo eeyateththa yo7oy inttes bessontta gishshas hessa malay intte garsan dooppo. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Qasseka intte laymatizaytas woykko tunatas woykko uuzettizaytassinne eeqas goynnizaytas Kirstoosa kawoteththaninne Xoossa Kawoteththan isttas laatasoy bayndayssa intte erite.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Inttena oonikka wordo haasayan baleththofo; gaasoykka Xoossa hanqoy izas azazettontta nayta bolla yaanay haytantta malanna. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Hessa gishshas hessantta malara zuppetopite. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Kase intte dhuma shin Godaan ha7i intte poo7o; intte poo7o nayta mala diite. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Poo7os ayfey lo7eteththan, xilloteththaninne tumateththan ubbaan dees.<verse eid="EPH 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Hessaththoka Godaa ufayssiza miish koyite. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Ayfey baynda dhuma oosora inttes aykko gaagoteththi dooppo; hessafe iita ooso qoncce kessite. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Dhuman diza asati geeman ooththiza miishsha gishshas haasayaykka yeellachchees. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Poo7oy poo7idaazi wuri qonccen beettees. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Gaasoykka ubbaa bessizay poo7o; hessa gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">«Nenoo, dhiskizaysso beegga!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">Hayqoppe denda!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">Kirstoosi nees poo7isana» geetettides.<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Hessa gishshas erateththi bayndayta mala gidontta intte waanidi erata mala daanaakko naagettite. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Hayssi wodezi iita gidida gishshas hessa lo7eththi erite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Qola 4:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Hessa gishshas eeyata gidopite; Godaa sheney aazakko yuushshi qopite.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Ayanay kumidayta gidite attiin maththosiza ushshan maththottofte; hessi coo mela miishsha laaleththa. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Ayana yeththan galatara gaththi yexxishe intte giddon issoy issaara haasayettite; intte sabaninne yeththan kumeththa wozinappe Godaa galatite. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Hessan Xoossa Aawaa, Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa sunththaa ubba miishshas ubba wode galatite.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Machchonne Azina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Intte Kirstoosa bonchchos giidi yashshara issoy issaas azazettite.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Machcheto intte Godaas haarettiza mala intte azinatas haarettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:18">Qola 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1Phex 3:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Kirstoosi ba asho gidida Woosa Keeththays hu7e gidida mala azinaykka ba machcheys hu7e. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Hessa gishshas Woosa Keeththiya Kirstoosas azazettiza mala machchetikka ba azinatas ay hanonkka azazettanaas bessees.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Azinatoo! Kirstoosi Woosa Keeththayo siiqida malanne bana izi gishshas aaththi immida mala intteka intte machcheta siiqite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:19">Qola 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1Phex 3:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Ba qaala baggara haaththan meecci geeshshi dummasides. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Hessaththoka qitay woykko ayfeso xirphoteththi woykko issi iitay izi bolla beettontta geeshshinne balay izi bolla bayndaaro bonchcho Woosa Keeththe histtidi shiishshanaassa. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Azinatikka hessaththo ba machcheta ba asho mala siiqanaas bessees; ba machcho siiqizaadey bana siiqees. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Barkka bana ixxizaadey oonikka deenna; ba ashos meessinne bana naagees; Kirstoosikka Woosa Keeththas hinniththo ooththides. <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />Nuni Kirstoosa asateththa. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Hessa gishshas, «Asi aayonne aawa aggidi ba machcheyra issino gidees; nam7ayka issi asho gideettes» geetetti Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Medhe 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Hayssi daro xuura yo7o; tanikka hayssa Kirstoosa gishshassinne Woosa Keeththa gishshas yootays. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Gidikkoka inttefe issi issaadey ba machcho bana siiqiza mala siiqo; machchaka ba azinaa bonchchu.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yelidaytanne Nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Naytoo! Intte inttena yelidaytas Godaan azazettite; hessi inttes bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:20">Qola 3:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />«Ne aawaanne ne aayo bonchcha» giza azazo giddon diza hidotay koyro azazo. <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />Ne hessaththo ooththiko nees lo7ananne nees layththay biittaa bolla aduqqana. <verse eid="EPH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Yelidaytoo! Intteka intte nayta hanqeththofte; gido attiin intte nayta Godaa zoreninne seeran dichchite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:21">Qola 3:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oosisizaytanne Ooththizayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Oosanchchatoo! Intte Kirstoosas azazettiza mala biitta bolla inttena oosisizaytas yashshateththaninne bonchchon suure wozinappe azazettite. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Coo asa ayfen beettana malanne oosisizaytappe doona anjjo ekkanaas gidontta intte Kirstoosa aylleta mala Xoossa shene kumeththa wozinappe polana mala wozinappe azazettite. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Asas ooththiza mala gidontta Godaas ooththiza mala intte kumeththa wozinappe ooththite. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Gaasoykka aylle gidiin woykko godaa gidiin ba ooththiza lo7o oosos ubbaas woyto ekkanayssa intte ereeta.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Intteno godatoo! Intteka intte oosisizaytas hessaththo ooththite; isttassinne inttes Godaa gididay bolla salon dizayssa; izikka ayfeso xeelli as maaddonttayssaka intteka eriza gishshas oosanchchata babiso aggidi lo7o ooththite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:1">Qola 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Zaare 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:25">Qola 3:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossafe Beettiza Ola Miish</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Hara baggara mino Godaaninne iza gita wolqqan minnite. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Daabulosa gene ooso intte eqettanaas dandayana mala Xoossaa ola may7ota may7ite. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Gaasoykka nu olettanay ashoranne suuththara gidontta hayssa dhuma alameza haariza godatara, wolqqamataranne salo bolla diza tuna ayana olanchchatara olettoos. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Iita gallassay gakkishin intte morkke wolqqara eqettanaas dandayana mala Xoossa ola may7ota kumeth may7ite; intte ubbaaka polidaappe guye minni eqqanaas dandayeeta.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Hessa gishshas intte xeessan tumaa zinnaare mala danccettidi xilloteththa xurureta mala tiran may7idi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xurure guussi beni wode ola asati tiran may7iza ola may7o.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:5">Isa 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">59:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />saroteththa Mishiraachcho qaalaa tohon caamma mala aaththidi giigetti eqqite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa 52:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Heytanttafekka bollara tama mala popol7u giza iita ayana wondafeta intte ubbaa toyssana dandayana mala ammano gondalle mala denththite. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Atoteth birata qoobe mala hu7en woththite; Ayana giththa mashsha oykkite; hessika Xoossa qaala.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Woosan ay hanonkka Ayanan woossite; hessa qoppidi beeggite; ammanizayta ubbaa gishshas qanxxontta woossite.<figure style="fig" alt="Roman soldier in armor" file="LB00196B.TIF" size="span" ref="6:18">Kumeththa ola massarara diza Oroome wottadara</figure> <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Tani Mishiraachcho qaala xuuraa asas qonccisanaas doona doyza ubba wode yashshi baynda ta xalateththan yootanaas qaalay taas imettana mala taas woossite. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Tani Mishiraachcho qaalaa gishshas sansalatan qashettada kiitettidaade gididay hessassa; hessa gishshas ta yootanaas bessizayssa babbontta yootana mala taas woossite.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurseththa Saroka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Ta ay mala dizaakkonne ay ooththizaakko intte erana mala dosettida ta ishay Godaas ammanettida oosanchchay Tiqiqoosi inttes hanidayssa wursika inttes yootana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Hawa 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2Xim 4:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Intte nu hanoteth erana malanne intte wozina izi minththeththana mala ta iza intteko yeddadis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21-22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:7-8">Qola 4:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Aawaa Xoossaafe, Godaa Yesus Kirstoosappe saroteththinne siiqoy ammanora inttes ta ishatas gido. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa pacey baynda siiqiza ubbaas saroteththi gido. Amiin.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>